1.  Introduction\par
Dynamic languagessuch as JavaScript, Python, and Ruby, are pop-\par
ular since they are expressive, accessible to non-experts, and make\par
deployment as easy as distributing a source file. They are used for\par
small scripts as well as for complex applications. JavaScript, for\par
example, is the de facto standard for client-side web programming\par
