we describe our approach of covering nested loops using a num-\par
ber of individual trace trees. In Section 5 we describe our trace-\par
compilation based speculative type specialization approach we use\par
to generate efficient machine code from recorded bytecode traces.\par
Our implementation of a dynamic type-specializing compiler for\par
JavaScript is described in Section 6. Related work is discussed in\par
Section 8. In Section 7 we evaluate our dynamic compiler based on\par
