4.1  Nesting Algorithm\par
The key insight is that if each loop is represented by its own trace\par
tree, the code for each loop can be contained only in its own tree,\par
and outer loop paths will not be duplicated. Another key fact is that\par
we are not tracing arbitrary bytecodes that might have irreduceable\par
