for a language with structured control flow. Thus, given two loop\par
edges, the system can easily determine whether they are nested\par
and which is the inner loop. Using this knowledge, the system can\par
compile inner and outer loops separately, and make the outer loop’s\par
tracescallthe inner loop’s trace tree.\par
